# Mega-TU module manifest for native-compose option (A) — see
# sv0c/doc/native-compose-tradeoffs.md. Paths relative to sv0c/, in pipeline order.
# Assembled by scripts/assemble-sv0-megaTU.py (./scripts/sv0 assemble-megatu).
#
# A1 status: FULL pipeline — all 18 modules assemble into one TU that compiles
# (SML -> C ~34k lines -> cc, binary runs). The assembler AUTO-NAMESPACES any name
# a module defines that an earlier module already claimed (the back-end's divergent
# core types Expr/Value/Instr/Ty become e.g. lowering_Value / codegen_Value /
# vm_codegen_Value, each with its uses rewritten self-consistently). Remaining for
# a working native compiler: A2 — replace the placeholder main with a compose main
# that threads the real phases (tokenize -> parse -> resolve -> check -> lower ->
# emit) over the shared arenas.

